{"html":"\n\t\t\n<p><span>Scars can affect both the appearance and confidence of an individual. At AestheticEye in Cincinnati, OH, our board-certified oculoplastic surgeons, Dr. Ginger Henson and Dr. Jonathan Pargament, specialize in <a href=\"#/cosmetic-skin-treatments/\">advanced treatments</a> for facial scar removal. We offer a variety of non-surgical solutions designed to minimize the appearance of scars and restore smooth, even skin. Our personalized approach ensures that each patient receives the highest standard of care tailored to their unique needs.</span></p>\n\n\n\n<div><div>\n<h2 id=\"section-1\">Understanding Facial Scars</h2>\n\n\n\n<p><span>Facial scars can result from various causes, including acne, injuries, surgeries, and inflammatory conditions. These scars can vary in appearance, size, and severity, affecting the skin’s texture and tone.</span></p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div>\n\n  \n\n  <a href=\"https://l.klara.com/G3yV4TBdY4dUMwAk\"> Book An Appointment</a>\n  <a aria-label=\"call us (937) 907-9009\" href=\"tel:9379079009\"> (937) 907-9009</a>\n</div></div>\n\n\n    <div>\n        <blockquote>\n            <div>Dr. Ginger Henson was a perfect choice for me! She did an excellent job. I had no pain and healed up better than ever! I’m so happy with the job she did for me!</div>\n                            <footer>Lynne S.</footer>\n                        \n        </blockquote>\n    </div>\n\n\n\n<div><div>\n<h3>Types of Facial Scars</h3>\n\n\n<div id=\"column-content-block_e89a44295a4fc6d55392fb84a0191843\" class=\"source-columns\">\n            <div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_e89a44295a4fc6d55392fb84a0191843-column-0\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Acne Scars</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Blemishes and pitted scars caused by severe acne.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_e89a44295a4fc6d55392fb84a0191843-column-1\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Surgical Scars</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Scars resulting from surgical procedures.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_e89a44295a4fc6d55392fb84a0191843-column-2\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Traumatic Scars</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Scars from injuries or accidents.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_e89a44295a4fc6d55392fb84a0191843-column-3\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Keloid Scars</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Raised, thickened scars that extend beyond the original wound.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_e89a44295a4fc6d55392fb84a0191843-column-4\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Hypertrophic Scars</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Raised scars that remain within the boundaries of the original wound.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                    </div>\n    </div></div>\n\n\n\n<div>\n\n  \n\n  <a href=\"https://l.klara.com/G3yV4TBdY4dUMwAk\"> Book An Appointment</a>\n  <a aria-label=\"call us (937) 907-9009\" href=\"tel:9379079009\"> (937) 907-9009</a>\n</div></div>\n\n\n<div><div>\n<h2 id=\"section-2\">Advanced Facial Scar Removal Treatments</h2>\n\n\n\n<p><span>At AestheticEye, we offer a range of advanced non-surgical treatments to address facial scars. Our expert surgeons will assess your specific needs and recommend the most appropriate treatments for you.</span></p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div>\n\n  \n\n  <a href=\"https://l.klara.com/G3yV4TBdY4dUMwAk\"> Book An Appointment</a>\n  <a aria-label=\"call us (937) 907-9009\" href=\"tel:9379079009\"> (937) 907-9009</a>\n</div></div>\n\n\n<div><div>\n<h3>Laser Scar Removal</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><span>Laser therapy is a highly effective treatment for reducing the appearance of scars. This minimally invasive procedure uses focused light energy to break down scar tissue and stimulate collagen production, resulting in smoother, more even skin.</span></p>\n\n\n<div id=\"column-content-block_abe81a3ed2c9b28c5495ce59a0f17ee9\" class=\"source-columns\">\n            <div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_abe81a3ed2c9b28c5495ce59a0f17ee9-column-0\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Precision Treatment</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Targets specific areas without damaging surrounding tissue.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_abe81a3ed2c9b28c5495ce59a0f17ee9-column-1\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Improves Texture and Tone</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Reduces scar visibility and enhances skin texture.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_abe81a3ed2c9b28c5495ce59a0f17ee9-column-2\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Minimal Downtime</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Most patients can resume normal activities shortly after treatment.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                    </div>\n    </div></div>\n\n\n\n<div>\n\n  \n\n  <a href=\"https://l.klara.com/G3yV4TBdY4dUMwAk\"> Book An Appointment</a>\n  <a aria-label=\"call us (937) 907-9009\" href=\"tel:9379079009\"> (937) 907-9009</a>\n</div></div>\n\n\n<div><div>\n<h3>Microneedling</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><span>Microneedling involves using fine needles to create micro-injuries in the skin, stimulating the body’s natural healing process and promoting collagen and elastin production. This treatment can improve the appearance of scars and rejuvenate the skin.</span></p>\n\n\n<div id=\"column-content-block_da258051fc9700cc4284d6b9d33024a8\" class=\"source-columns\">\n            <div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_da258051fc9700cc4284d6b9d33024a8-column-0\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Enhanced Skin Renewal</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Promotes the regeneration of healthy skin cells.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_da258051fc9700cc4284d6b9d33024a8-column-1\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Reduces Scar Visibility</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Effective for both new and old scars.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_da258051fc9700cc4284d6b9d33024a8-column-2\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Quick Recovery</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Minimal downtime with only mild redness and swelling.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                    </div>\n    </div></div>\n\n\n\n<div>\n\n  \n\n  <a href=\"https://l.klara.com/G3yV4TBdY4dUMwAk\"> Book An Appointment</a>\n  <a aria-label=\"call us (937) 907-9009\" href=\"tel:9379079009\"> (937) 907-9009</a>\n</div></div>\n\n\n<div><div>\n<h3>Chemical Peels</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><span>Chemical peels use a specialized solution to exfoliate the top layers of skin, encouraging the growth of new, healthy skin cells. This treatment can improve skin texture, reduce pigmentation, and minimize the appearance of scars.</span></p>\n\n\n<div id=\"column-content-block_3766309753276f223b4e9d7a07b7dcfb\" class=\"source-columns\">\n            <div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_3766309753276f223b4e9d7a07b7dcfb-column-0\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Customized Treatments</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Peels can be tailored to your skin type and concerns.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_3766309753276f223b4e9d7a07b7dcfb-column-1\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Effective Results</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Improve skin texture, tone, and reduce pigmentation.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_3766309753276f223b4e9d7a07b7dcfb-column-2\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Non-Invasive</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Requires little to no downtime for lighter peels.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                    </div>\n    </div></div>\n\n\n\n<div>\n\n  \n\n  <a href=\"https://l.klara.com/G3yV4TBdY4dUMwAk\"> Book An Appointment</a>\n  <a aria-label=\"call us (937) 907-9009\" href=\"tel:9379079009\"> (937) 907-9009</a>\n</div></div>\n\n\n<div><div>\n<h3>Injectable Treatments</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><span>Injectable treatments, such as corticosteroids or other anti-inflammatory medications, can be used to reduce the appearance of raised scars. These injections can soften and flatten scars, improving their appearance and feel.</span></p>\n\n\n<div id=\"column-content-block_a14473cd599be29da8c173e1475187a1\" class=\"source-columns\">\n            <div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_a14473cd599be29da8c173e1475187a1-column-0\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Targeted Action</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Directly treats scar tissue to reduce its size and visibility.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_a14473cd599be29da8c173e1475187a1-column-1\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Quick Procedure</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Minimal discomfort and no downtime.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_a14473cd599be29da8c173e1475187a1-column-2\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Effective for Hypertrophic Scars</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Particularly useful for raised or thickened scars.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                    </div>\n    </div></div>\n\n\n\n<div>\n\n  \n\n  <a href=\"https://l.klara.com/G3yV4TBdY4dUMwAk\"> Book An Appointment</a>\n  <a aria-label=\"call us (937) 907-9009\" href=\"tel:9379079009\"> (937) 907-9009</a>\n</div></div>\n\n\n<div><div>\n<h3>Topical Treatments</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><span>Topical treatments, including prescription creams and gels, can help reduce the appearance of scars over time. These treatments often contain ingredients like retinoids, silicone, or vitamin C to promote healing and improve skin texture.</span></p>\n\n\n<div id=\"column-content-block_3ee9dd26d3d7e2ab9053fd95d59cd68e\" class=\"source-columns\">\n            <div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_3ee9dd26d3d7e2ab9053fd95d59cd68e-column-0\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Easy Application</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Simple to incorporate into your daily skincare routine.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_3ee9dd26d3d7e2ab9053fd95d59cd68e-column-1\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Gradual Improvement</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Noticeable results with consistent use.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_3ee9dd26d3d7e2ab9053fd95d59cd68e-column-2\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Non-Invasive</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>No discomfort or downtime.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                    </div>\n    </div></div>\n\n\n\n<div>\n\n  \n\n  <a href=\"https://l.klara.com/G3yV4TBdY4dUMwAk\"> Book An Appointment</a>\n  <a aria-label=\"call us (937) 907-9009\" href=\"tel:9379079009\"> (937) 907-9009</a>\n</div></div>\n\n\n<div><div>\n<h2 id=\"section-3\">Why Choose Non-Surgical Scar Treatment?</h2>\n\n\n\n<p><span>Choosing facial scar removal treatments at AestheticEye offers numerous benefits, helping you achieve smoother and more even skin.</span></p>\n\n\n\n<h3>Natural-Looking Results</h3>\n\n\n<div id=\"column-content-block_0d893fa7cdb13ec8377b73142f0bc704\" class=\"source-columns\">\n            <div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_0d893fa7cdb13ec8377b73142f0bc704-column-0\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Subtle Enhancements</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Achieve a natural, improved look without drastic changes.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_0d893fa7cdb13ec8377b73142f0bc704-column-1\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Tailored Approach</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Treatments customized to your specific needs and aesthetic goals.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n\n\n<h3>Minimal Downtime</h3>\n\n\n<div id=\"column-content-block_08bababf007d15b387e52111dd4bec0e\" class=\"source-columns\">\n            <div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_08bababf007d15b387e52111dd4bec0e-column-0\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Quick Recovery</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Most procedures require little to no downtime, allowing you to resume normal activities immediately.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_08bababf007d15b387e52111dd4bec0e-column-1\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Convenient</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Many treatments can be completed in under an hour.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n\n\n<h3>Long-Lasting Effects</h3>\n\n\n<div id=\"column-content-block_40da50c4b40d57c8cacce59dd58dfda5\" class=\"source-columns\">\n            <div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_40da50c4b40d57c8cacce59dd58dfda5-column-0\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Sustained Results</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Enjoy the benefits of your treatments for months to years, depending on the procedure.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_40da50c4b40d57c8cacce59dd58dfda5-column-1\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Boosted Confidence</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Feel more confident and comfortable with your appearance.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                    </div>\n    </div></div>\n\n\n\n<div>\n\n  \n\n  <a href=\"https://l.klara.com/G3yV4TBdY4dUMwAk\"> Book An Appointment</a>\n  <a aria-label=\"call us (937) 907-9009\" href=\"tel:9379079009\"> (937) 907-9009</a>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"section-4\">Schedule Your Consultation for Facial Scar Removal in Cincinnati</h2>\n\n\n\n<p><span>If you are seeking effective solutions for facial scar removal, contact AestheticEye today to </span><a href=\"#/contact/\">schedule a consultation</a><span>. Our expert surgeons, Dr. Ginger Henson and Dr. Jonathan Pargament, are dedicated to providing the highest level of care and advanced cosmetic treatments. Discover how our personalized approach can help you achieve smoother, more even skin and restore your confidence at AestheticEye.</span></p>\n"}